        {
            "id": "https://togetoge.cc/2026ci-ci-dong-nan-ya-xun-hui-yan-chang-hui-ji-xing-xin-jia-po-pian/",
            "url": "https://togetoge.cc/2026ci-ci-dong-nan-ya-xun-hui-yan-chang-hui-ji-xing-xin-jia-po-pian/",
            "title": "2026刺刺東南亞巡迴演唱會紀行③─新加坡篇",
            "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://togetoge.cc/he-wei-wu-ci-you-ci/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">川崎第一女團無刺有刺</a>於2026年8/14、8/16、8/19三天，分別於泰國曼谷、印尼雅加達以及新加坡展開巡迴演出。筆者毅然決然取得了三場的VIP票，決定與愛團一同巡迴。本篇為最終站─新加坡（大多都在吃美食）篇。</p>\n",
            "author": {
                "name": "SYM"
            },
            "tags": [
                   "旅遊紀行"
            ],
            "date_published": "2026-10-04T14:29:27+09:00",
